<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Querendo fazer coisas misteriosas</font></i>

282
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:08,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Boken shitakute</i></font>

283
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:08,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Querendo viver aventuras</font></i>

284
00:21:08,540 --> 00:21:14,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Dare mo min'na uzu-uzu shite 'ru</i></font>

285
00:21:08,540 --> 00:21:14,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Todos estão ansiosos para partir!</font></i>

286
00:21:14,510 --> 00:21:20,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Otona no furi shite akiramecha</i></font>

287
00:21:14,510 --> 00:21:20,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Se agir como adulto e desistir</font></i>

288
00:21:20,520 --> 00:21:26,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kiseki no nazo nado tokenai yo</i></font>

289
00:21:20,520 --> 00:21:26,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Nunca desvendará o mistério do milagre!</font></i>

290
00:21:26,690 --> 00:21:37,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Motto wairudo ni motto takumashiku ikite goran</i></font>

291
00:21:26,690 --> 00:21:37,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i><i>Vá em frente e viva de forma ainda mais selvagem e forte!</font></i></i>

292
00:21:37,830 --> 00:21:45,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Romantikku ageru yo, romantikku ageru yo</i></font>

293
00:21:37,830 --> 00:21:45,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i><i>Vou lhe dar romance, vou lhe dar romance</font></i></i>

